---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import {
  CONTACT_HREF,
  PLAN_INTRO,
  PLAN_PATH,
  PLAN_TITLE,
} from "../config.ts";
---

<Base title={PLAN_TITLE} description={PLAN_INTRO.join(" ")} path={PLAN_PATH}>
  <article class="plan">
    <header class="plan__header">
      <h1 class="sr-only">In The Loop</h1>
      <div class="plan__intro">
        {PLAN_INTRO.map((paragraph, index) => (
          <p>
            {index === PLAN_INTRO.length - 1 ? <strong>{paragraph}</strong> : paragraph}
          </p>
        ))}
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="plan__section" aria-labelledby="find-heading">
      <h2 class="plan__heading" id="find-heading">Discover what matters</h2>
      <div class="plan__copy">
        <p><strong>Signal</strong> curates the articles, podcasts, research and tools worth following on the frontier.</p>
        <p><strong>Skills</strong> indexes agent skills for startup work: research, growth, hiring, fundraising and operations.</p>
        <p>Together, they keep us close to what is emerging and what already works. We mostly curate. Where something important is missing, we build it.</p>
        <p>But capability is only part of what an agent needs to work well inside a startup.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plan__section" aria-labelledby="context-heading">
      <h2 class="plan__heading" id="context-heading">Install the context</h2>
      <div class="plan__copy">
        <p>What an agent should do depends on the startup.</p>
        <p>The <strong>Harness</strong> installs the context agents need to understand it: strategy, customers, product, decisions, feedback and metrics. It also connects them to the tools, memory and permissions they need to act.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plan__section" aria-labelledby="use-heading">
      <h2 class="plan__heading" id="use-heading">Let use decide</h2>
      <div class="plan__copy">
        <p>We put the Skills and Harness to work with founders and early operators instead of guessing what to build next.</p>
        <p>Use tells us where to go deeper. When a workflow keeps creating value, we build an <strong>Agent</strong> around it, put it back into use and learn again.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plan__section" aria-labelledby="newsletter-heading">
      <h2 class="plan__heading" id="newsletter-heading">Share what we learn</h2>
      <div class="plan__copy">
        <p><strong>Signal</strong> and <strong>Skills</strong> are useful on their own. The <strong>Newsletter</strong> keeps us in touch with the founders and early operators who find them.</p>
        <p>Some readers become customers. Their use and feedback shape what we build next.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="plan__section plan__close">
      <div class="plan__copy">
        <p>We are early and working in the open. If you are figuring this out too, <a class="link plan__contact" href={CONTACT_HREF}>get in touch</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
